Tested on Motorola Edge 30 (motorola-dubai)
Signed-off-by: Lona Lit <artlav@mm.st>
Signed-off-by: Marcus Ramberg <marcus@means.no>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/Makefile  |    1 +
 drivers/media/i2c/gc02m1b.c | 1184 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 1185 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/i2c/gc02m1b.c

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/Makefile b/drivers/media/i2c/Makefile
index 91c33b4c17ac..c93594e3a905 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/Makefile
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@ obj-$(CONFIG_VIDEO_DW9719) += dw9719.o
