+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * A V4L2 driver for Galaxycore GC02M1B.
+ * Monochrome 2MP, 1/5", 1.75um, 30FPS, D-PHY CIS.
+ * Should be relatively easy to adapt to GC02M1.
+ * Tested on Motorola Edge 30 (motorola-dubai).
+ */
+
